OL,3,GNEWSAFounders of elite college used #5m
OL,4,Afunds as 'personal piggy bank', court
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe founders of an elite Cardiff
OL,8,Fcollege treated its funds "as their own
OL,9,Fpersonal piggy bank", a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FOne of its founders, Yasmin Sarwar, is
OL,13,Faccused of stealing #5m from Cardiff
OL,14,FSixth Form College's accounts. Her
OL,15,Fex-husband, Nadeem Sarwar, pleaded
OL,16,Fguilty to stealing #5m at an earlier
OL,17,Fhearing.
OL,19,FMark Cotter KC, prosecuting, told the
OL,20,Fcourt the pair set up the college in
OL,21,F2008 and were "paid handsomely" for
OL,22,Ftheir roles.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
