OL,3,GNEWSAFounders of elite college used #5m
OL,4,Afunds as 'personal piggy bank', court
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FYasmin Sarwar, who was a director and
OL,8,Ftrustee at the college, denies nine
OL,9,Ftheft and fraud charges and is standing
OL,10,Ftrial at Merthyr Crown Court.
